---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout, { type SEOProps } from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'

const seo: SEOProps = {
  title: 'Confession Time: 3rd Edition Confessions | Nomad Magazine Newsletter',
  description: 'The latest updates from the Nomad Magazine team. Featuring confessions about the 3rd edition, digital-first approach, and community updates.',
  image: `${Astro.site}images/edition-003-cover.webp`,
  keywords: 'nomad magazine newsletter, 3rd edition confessions, digital nomad updates, nomad community',
  ogType: 'article',
  ldJSON: {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Article',
    headline: 'Confession Time: 3rd Edition Confessions',
    description: 'The latest updates from the Nomad Magazine team. Featuring confessions about the 3rd edition, digital-first approach, and community updates.',
    author: {
      '@type': 'Organization',
      name: 'Nomad Magazine',
    },
    publisher: {
      '@type': 'Organization',
      name: 'Nomad Magazine',
      logo: {
        '@type': 'ImageObject',
        url: `${Astro.site}logo.svg`,
      },
    },
    datePublished: '2025-05-22',
    url: `${Astro.site}newsletter-3rd-edition-confessions/`,
  },
}
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="border-b border-gray-100">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg font-medium">May 22, 2025</p>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Hero Image -->
          <div class="mb-8">
            <img 
              src="/images/issue-003-nomad-magazine-newsletter-confession.jpg" 
              alt="Confession Time - 3rd Edition artistic header with magazine covers and creative elements" 
              class="mx-auto max-w-full h-auto rounded-2xl shadow-2xl"
            />
          </div>
          
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
            confession time
          </h1>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-yellow-600 mb-6">
            3rd Edition: Confessions
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            The next edition coming your way will be <strong>print-first</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Confession Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              The next edition of our magazine is going to be huge. I'm excited—but slightly terrified 😅
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              When you've published two editions and set the bar quite high, the next one has to be even better. 
              It's like hand-picking a gift for someone you really care about—and worrying until the very last 
              second whether they'll like it.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Our new team of designers from Brazil has taken your nomad experiences, wisdom, and advice and 
              wrapped it all up into something beautiful. Every article has its own custom design.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              <strong>The third edition is officially in final proofreading, and this baby is going to print soon!</strong>
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              It will land in Bansko first, and then it's off to the first people who pre-ordered, and to our trusted 
              partners in Lisbon, London, Berlin, Barcelona, Porto, Madeira, and Amsterdam 🌍
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              This edition is more experimental. We allowed ourselves to explore themes around <strong>wellness, therapy, 
              building relationships, and digital health products</strong>. But we also kept a balance—with articles on 
              AI trends for entrepreneurs, virtual assistants, overtourism, supporting local economies, and new ways 
              to approach affordable living—like housesitting.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              And of course, we want to inspire your travels with real stories from <strong>Buenos Aires</strong>, a photo story 
              from <strong>Cape Town</strong>, and my personal favorite: a hidden gem in <strong>Guatemala</strong>.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              <strong>And the cherry on top?</strong><br>
              An exclusive piece by Mindvalley author, course creator, and dear friend <strong>Jimmy Naraine</strong>. You might 
              know him from Nomad Cruise, where he's become a regular speaker and core part of the community. He's also 
              known for his highly-rated courses on Mindvalley and Udemy, which have reached over 300,000 students worldwide.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              In this edition, Jimmy shares his wisdom and advice from <strong>12 years of travel through 90 countries</strong>—and 
              how he built a strong personal brand along the way 👏
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              While preparing for Bansko, I realized this magazine is not about us (as a company). It's about you—your 
              experience as a nomad and a human—and the companies working their asses off to make our global lives easier, 
              more fun, and less lonely.
            </p>
            
            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-6 mb-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📆 When can you get your hands on a copy? 🙋‍♀️</h3>
              
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                You'll be able to visit one of our partners in <strong>July</strong> (stay tuned for the exact date). Or, if you 
                order a print copy, I will send you a <strong>signed copy straight from Bulgaria</strong>. Digital is great—but 
                print is very special.
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                <a href="/editions/third-edition/" class="text-yellow-600 font-bold hover:text-yellow-700 underline">Order copy</a> 
                and you'll be the first to get all the details!
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                If you bought a previous edition and have any feedback about your experience, we'd love to hear it—so 
                we don't repeat the same mistakes.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              See you on Nomad Cruise, at Bansko Nomad Fest, in Madeira, or in the pages of this <strong>110-page masterpiece</strong>.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
              Thank you for your support and continued love of our magazine,<br>
              <strong>Lera 🤍</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Newsletter CTA -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border-2 border-yellow-200">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Share your confession?</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              If you think you have something to confess about your nomad journey, we'd love to hear from you.
            </p>
            <a
              href="mailto:hey@nomadmagazine.com?subject=My Nomad Confession"
              class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-colors"
            >
              Send Your Story
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Gossip Roundup Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-pink-500">🗣️</span>
            Gossip Roundup
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Latest buzz from the nomad community</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-pink-200">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">‼️</span>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                Be careful with your travel plans, nomads! <a href="https://home-affairs.ec.europa.eu/news/bulgaria-and-romania-join-schengen-area-2025-01-03_en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:text-pink-700 underline" aria-label="Read about Bulgaria and Romania joining the Schengen Zone (opens in new tab)">Bulgaria and Romania joined the Schengen Zone in 2025</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">🌍</span>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                <a href="https://evolvecoliving.io/ultimate-guide-digital-nomad-visas-worldwide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:text-pink-700 underline" aria-label="Read about 70 countries offering digital nomad visas (opens in new tab)">These 70 countries now offer DN visas</a>—a huge increase in choices
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">💰</span>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                Tax competition is driving <a href="https://thenomadtax.com/en/2025/03/best-countries-for-digital-nomad-families/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:text-pink-700 underline" aria-label="Read about tax competition and emigration (opens in new tab)">waves of emigration</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">🤔</span>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                What sort of impact are digital nomads having on the world? <a href="https://allwork.space/2024/09/will-tourism-backlash-kill-digital-nomadism/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:text-pink-700 underline" aria-label="Read analysis on digital nomad impact (opens in new tab)">Read this analysis to hear both sides</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- News from us Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-blue-500">📚</span>
            News from us
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Updates from the Nomad Magazine team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-blue-200">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="text-3xl">📚</div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                  Books for digital nomads at <a href="https://www.banskonomadfest.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 font-bold hover:text-blue-700 underline" aria-label="Visit Bansko Nomad Fest website (opens in new tab)">Bansko Nomad Fest</a>...
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                  As ambassadors of the printed word here at NGM, we're setting up a <strong>Book Corner</strong> right at 
                  our booth right alongside the <strong>latest edition of our magazine</strong>.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                  Pop along to check them out, or just for a chat — we're very friendly! 👋
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- YouTube Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-500">🎬</span>
            On Our YouTube:
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Latest video content</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-200">
          <div class="text-left">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              ✏️ In this inspiring interview, <a href="#" class="text-red-600 font-bold hover:text-red-700 underline">Marko Ferek</a>—motivational speaker, founder of the non-profit Budenje, and VP of ADHD Europe—shares how he turned his ADHD diagnosis into a mission to change education, empower neurodiverse kids, and help others thrive through focus training and alternative learning.
            </p>
            
            <div class="mb-6">
              <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">💡 Topics covered:</p>
              <div class="space-y-2 ml-4">
                <p class="text-gray-800">🔹 ADHD and digital nomadism</p>
                <p class="text-gray-800">🔹 Why traditional school systems fail neurodiverse kids</p>
                <p class="text-gray-800">🔹 Marko's viral "No Homework" movement in Croatia</p>
                <p class="text-gray-800">🔹 And why the nomadic lifestyle suits ADHD minds so well</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-8">
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KZPVPGtcRhU" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Watch ADHD fits nomad life video on YouTube">
                <img 
                  src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/KZPVPGtcRhU/hqdefault.jpg" 
                  alt="Marko Ferek - ADHD fits nomad life YouTube video thumbnail" 
                  class="mx-auto max-w-md h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
                />
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              🎥 Filmed on <a href="#" class="text-red-600 font-bold hover:text-red-700 underline">Nomad Cruise</a> - the epic conference for digital nomads at sea
            </p>

            <div class="text-center mb-6">
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 mb-4">
                👉 Watch <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KZPVPGtcRhU&t=5s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 font-bold hover:text-red-700 underline" aria-label="Watch video on YouTube (opens in new tab)">now</a>!
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Nomad Events Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-green-500">📅</span>
            Nomad Events
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Pick your journey from the upcoming events or you can list yours HERE. NGM will be at these a few:</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-green-200">
          
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <!-- THE NOMAD WORLD FEST -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xl mb-2">STARTS THIS SUNDAY!</h4>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">THE NOMAD WORLD FEST</h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📅 25 - 31 May 2025</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📍 Albufeira, Portugal</p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 mb-2">
                🔗 <a href="https://thenomadworld.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 underline" aria-label="Visit The Nomad World website (opens in new tab)">https://thenomadworld.org/</a>
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 italic">
                Magic discount code <span class="font-bold text-green-600">NGMXTNW</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- NOMAD CRUISE 14 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-2">NOMAD CRUISE 14: THE MEDITERRANEAN EDITION</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📅 6 - 14 June 2025</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📍 France - Italy - Malta - Greece</p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 mb-2">
                🔗 <a href="https://www.nomadcruise.com/nc14" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline" aria-label="Visit Nomad Cruise NC14 website (opens in new tab)">https://www.nomadcruise.com/nc14</a>
              </p>
              <p class="text-red-600 font-bold italic">SOLD OUT!</p>
            </div>

            <!-- BANSKO NOMAD FEST -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-2">BANSKO NOMAD FEST ⛰️</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📅 22 - 29 June 2025</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📍 Bansko, Bulgaria</p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 mb-4">
                🔗 <a href="https://www.banskonomadfest.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 underline" aria-label="Visit Bansko Nomad Fest website (opens in new tab)">https://www.banskonomadfest.com/</a>
              </p>
              
              <div class="bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200 mb-4">
                <p class="text-gray-800">
                  Use code <span class="font-bold text-yellow-600">NGM_BNF25</span> for discount! NGM will be there, and our third edition will 
                  land into welcome packs 😉
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- COLIVE FUKUOKA -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-2">COLIVE FUKUOKA</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📅 October 1 - November 1 2025</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📍 Fukuoka, Japan</p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 mb-2">
                🔗 <a href="https://colivefukuoka.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline" aria-label="Visit Colive Fukuoka website (opens in new tab)">https://colivefukuoka.com/</a>
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 italic">
                Tickets are selling fast. Use code <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">GOSSIP</span> for a 20% discount 🤑
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- NOMAD CRUISE 10 YEAR ANNIVERSARY -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <p class="text-gray-800 mb-2">
                  And to remind you, Nomad Cruise will be hosting the craziest Nomad Cruise 
                  ever for their <span class="font-bold">10 YEAR ANNIVERSARY</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📅 October 12 - November 9 2025</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">📍 Seattle - Hawaii - South Pacific Islands - Sydney</p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 mb-2">
                🔗 <a href="https://www.nomadcruise.com/nc15" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline" aria-label="Visit Nomad Cruise NC15 website (opens in new tab)">https://www.nomadcruise.com/nc15</a>
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-800 italic">
                Secure your spot with discount code <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">GOSSIP</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- About the Magazine Section -->
      <section class="mb-20">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-purple-500">📖</span>
            About the Magazine:
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-purple-200">
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-800">
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              • Launched in 2024, NGM is a print-first magazine that captures the essence of 
              the nomadic lifestyle, blending deep storytelling with stunning visuals.
            </p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              • It covers topics such as:
            </p>
            <div class="ml-6 space-y-2">
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ Inspiring Stories: From challenges of commitment to tales of nomadic 
                love and business success.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ Cultural Exploration: A deep dive into places like Mongolia, Buenos Aires, 
                and nomad-friendly regions around the globe.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ Community Spotlights: Featuring coworking spaces, coliving hubs, and 
                nomad festivals.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ Practical Guidance: Tips on productivity, mental health, and navigating 
                the digital nomad lifestyle.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ First edition is <a href="#" class="text-purple-600 font-bold hover:text-purple-700 underline">HERE</a>.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ We are still accepting advertising for the 3rd edition, launching at Bansko 
                Nomad Fest, delivering to 100+ coworking spaces. Reach out to 
                <a href="mailto:lera@nomadgossip.com" class="text-red-600 font-bold hover:text-red-700">lera@nomadgossip.com</a>.
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                ○ Follow us on <a href="#" class="text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 underline">Instagram</a> and <a href="#" class="text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 underline">YouTube</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- LikeProject Section -->
      <section class="like-project-section relative z-[1000] bg-gray-50 px-4 py-20 text-center text-gray-900 md:px-8">
        <div class="container mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">Like this project?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Stay in the loop for future of NGM</p>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-gray-600">Subscribe to our mailing list and give us a follow on Instagram to keep up to date on the latest nomad-related updates.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="/newsletter/" class="text-md flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-black px-4 py-3 font-bold text-white" aria-label="Subscribe to newsletter">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 4.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>SUBSCRIBE</span>
            </a>
            <a
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              href="https://www.instagram.com/nomadmagazinecom"
              class="text-md flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-black bg-white px-4 py-3 font-bold text-black"
              aria-label="Follow us on Instagram (opens in new tab)"
            >
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12.017 0C5.396 0 .029 5.367.029 11.987c0 6.62 5.367 11.987 11.988 11.987s11.987-5.367 11.987-11.987C24.004 5.367 18.637.001 12.017.001zM8.449 16.988c-1.297 0-2.348-1.051-2.348-2.348s1.051-2.348 2.348-2.348 2.348 1.051 2.348 2.348-1.051 2.348-2.348 2.348zm3.568 0c-1.297 0-2.348-1.051-2.348-2.348s1.051-2.348 2.348-2.348 2.348 1.051 2.348 2.348-1.051 2.348-2.348 2.348zm3.568 0c-1.297 0-2.348-1.051-2.348-2.348s1.051-2.348 2.348-2.348 2.348 1.051 2.348 2.348-1.051 2.348-2.348 2.348z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>FOLLOW US</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout> 
